            "review_title": "Review at Zpizza",
            "review_text": "Lan N\nHanoi, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nWorst pizza ever. Never come back.\nMar 2017 • Family\nStopped by for dinner and turnt out an experience of the worst pizza in my life. I can not imagine pizza can be that bad. \nThey were launching a promotion program, and different staff explained it to us in a different ways, like they were trying to dodge the program. First they said it is applied only for takeaway. When I showed them the voucher saying promotion can go with \"dine at the restaurant\", they answered \"not this restaurant\" (we were at Zpizza on Xuan dieu). Meanwhile, the voucher lists out all Zpizza restaurants. We didnt want to argue any more, decided to forget about the voucher and ordered two pizza. \nThe staff made a mistake when mishearding our order and brought out Magherita. It was so bad, nothing but a thin layer of watery tomato sauce on top. Totally disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 16, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
