            "review_title": "Review at Zpizza",
            "review_text": "NamNguyen1992\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nFriendly staff and stunning food\nMay 2016 • Couples\nI just want to commend Hang, Tuan Anh & Ha at Zpizza Xuan Dieu for a truly great dining experience. My girlfriend and I enjoyed a wonderful date and I must say that the food and service were both outstanding, but the hospitality was truly above all…amazing. \n\nHằng took the time to explain my options and made suggestions about how I might find something I would like. She was extremely kind, patient and very \"happy\", making our experience delightful. I and my girl friend had a set lunch with Ceasar Salad, Bolognese and Beef Pizza.\n\nTuan Anh and Ha were very friendly, quick, observant, and smiles on all. We never had to ask for anything, as Tuan Anh & Ha paid attention and took the initiative to go the extra step to provide outstanding services.\n\nThanks again and continued success to the restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 26, 2016",
