            "review_title": "Review at Zpizza",
            "review_text": "Merryl L\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nI like pesto!\nNov 2015 • Friends\nI generally get delivery though I've been to the restaurant a few times. the food is good. the build your own pizza option is great. the staff is great. I'm pleased with zpizza. I was ordering from another restaurant as well, and in comparison I have to say that in the 3 months that I've been in Vietnam (without a kitchen) zpizza has consistently served good food with good delivery times and great customer service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 20, 2016",
