            "review_title": "Review at Zpizza",
            "review_text": "Emma L\nSaumur, France38 contributions\n0\nSlow service and noisy\nOct 2013 • Solo\nWent here on a Sunday because I wanted something quick to eat and hey, what's faster than pizza? I'd been to their branch on Xuan Dieu in Tay Ho before and had quite liked it, so I tried their branch in the Old Town. \nThe service was so slow (40 mins to get my pizza) and the pizza came before the appetizers. I know they weren't overun with orders because I was sat just next to the kitchen area and I could see most of the employees leaning against the wall doing nothing!\n\nThe pizza itself was correct, it was what I expected to get. However, all things considered I won't be going back there again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 30, 2013",
